Package: supershot
Version: 1.2.2
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 11264
Depends: libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.14), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.5), xdg-desktop-portal-gnome | gnome-screenshot, libglib2.0-bin
Maintainer: axpnet <https://github.com/axpnet>
Homepage: https://github.com/axpnet/supershot
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/axpnet/supershot.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/axpnet/supershot
Description: GTK4/Libadwaita screenshot tool for GNOME
 SuperShot is a native screenshot tool for GNOME desktops with configurable
 delay timer, PNG/JPEG format selection, date/time watermark, image editor
 (rotate, flip, brightness, contrast, blur, sharpen, grayscale, invert),
 crop with resolution display, custom save directory, automatic clipboard
 copy, clickable desktop notifications, X11 fallback support, CLI headless
 mode, and 14 language translations. Built with GTK4 and Libadwaita.
